00:28:44.960 --> 00:28:47.160
painkillers. And I'm like, I've never said

00:28:47.160 --> 00:28:49.720
that I was in pain once. I've never complained about

00:28:49.720 --> 00:28:51.200
being in pain once. What's happening?

00:28:51.200 --> 00:28:54.760
Like, and I had the messages that I was sending before the

00:28:54.760 --> 00:28:56.840
accident and it's like, I'm just talking normally.

00:28:56.840 --> 00:28:58.000
It doesn't sound like I'm in pain.

00:28:58.000 --> 00:28:59.680
What's the story? But I didn't realise the main

00:28:59.680 --> 00:29:02.600
accident was actually after the helicopter arrived.

00:29:03.760 --> 00:29:08.120
So yeah, my head was, it was hard to think straight and you

00:29:08.280 --> 00:29:11.720
get all funny kinds of dreams and you're not really sure what

00:29:11.720 --> 00:29:13.840
reality is when you're getting all these drugs.

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:16.560
I got off the drug straight away as soon as I found out I was on

00:29:16.560 --> 00:29:19.840
them before. He's been trying to get off

00:29:19.840 --> 00:29:22.120
drugs quickly and I haven't been on drugs since I left the

00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:25.280
hospital after the rehab. But yeah, so.

00:29:25.280 --> 00:29:31.240
But basically, after all the injuries, the internal injuries

00:29:31.360 --> 00:29:34.360
had calmed down and I'd been off the drugs and then I'd been able

00:29:34.360 --> 00:29:37.760
to sleep a bit better. Then I became a bit more back to

00:29:37.760 --> 00:29:41.680
normal. And there was never any really

00:29:41.680 --> 00:29:45.880
sudden psychological recovery or damage or anything like that.

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:49.000
I always knew it was dangerous activity.

00:29:49.040 --> 00:29:53.200
I figured, Yep, OK, what could have happened finally happened.

00:29:53.200 --> 00:29:58.960
And yeah, And when I made the video, about probably 5 months,

00:29:58.960 --> 00:30:03.520
four or five months after the accident, I got everything that

00:30:03.520 --> 00:30:06.800
I knew, basically the messages I'd sent on my phone, the

00:30:06.960 --> 00:30:10.360
conversations I've had with other people, the video footage

00:30:10.360 --> 00:30:14.080
that I had, the track logs. And I put everything I knew into

00:30:14.080 --> 00:30:17.120
the video. And it wasn't really an

00:30:17.120 --> 00:30:19.240
emotional thing for me. I was just thinking like, what

00:30:19.440 --> 00:30:21.520
was there some particular risk that applied the day?

00:30:21.520 --> 00:30:25.400
And I was like, yeah, it wasn't really anything in particular

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:28.160
that was risky about that day. I've done a lot more sillier

00:30:28.160 --> 00:30:30.680
things than that. And it is what it is.

00:30:31.160 --> 00:30:34.080
I would say in general, when you're flying in the mountains,

00:30:34.080 --> 00:30:35.960
it often happens that you're close to terrain.

00:30:35.960 --> 00:30:38.080
And if something happens when you're close to terrain, you

00:30:38.080 --> 00:30:40.760
don't have much time to get the wing flying again.

00:30:40.760 --> 00:30:42.040
