00:31:44.240 --> 00:31:48.120
of the responsibility for it. So yeah, basically you're

00:31:48.120 --> 00:31:51.400
talking about the psychological effects in, in, in terms of,

00:31:52.600 --> 00:31:54.640
yes. So the accident, it was always

00:31:54.640 --> 00:31:56.800
dangerous, always could have happened in terms of what can

00:31:56.800 --> 00:32:00.680
