rescue choppers are first of all, like double engine,

00:32:46.440 --> 00:32:49.920
massively heavy, insane amounts of downwash from the rotors.

00:32:50.320 --> 00:32:54.160
And then you come across a pilot who is lying motionless but

00:32:54.160 --> 00:32:57.000
still connected. The amount of damage that you

00:32:57.000 --> 00:33:00.960
can create by swatting around already injured pilot is insane.

00:33:00.960 --> 00:33:02.400
And this is what makes me angry, man.

00:33:02.400 --> 00:33:05.600
Like if somebody fucked up, like if that pilot fucked up, even if

00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:08.000
it was unintentional, like at least make it public so other

00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:11.840
pilots don't. Because I do clearly remember I

