there was a girl, I don't know which episode but where had a

00:33:23.400 --> 00:33:26.320
crash called in the chopper, was unconscious, the chopper comes

00:33:26.320 --> 00:33:29.360
in, blows her further away and she passes away from that.

00:33:29.840 --> 00:33:32.920
The more we try to suppress such information, the more

00:33:32.920 --> 00:33:36.320
susceptible we make the future generations to be facing the

00:33:36.320 --> 00:33:37.880
same consequences without learning from it.

00:33:38.120 --> 00:33:41.480
Even if it makes owning up your fuck ups.

