level. The easiest way is to just

00:33:45.680 --> 00:33:51.360
swallow the heart pill and do it for the sake of tomorrow and not

00:33:51.360 --> 00:33:52.920
for the sake of saving your ass today.

00:33:53.680 --> 00:33:57.040
Yeah. So the organization made those

00:33:57.040 --> 00:33:59.920
decisions for whatever reasons they made them for.

