So some of the time I would get UPS, you know, or, or, you know,

00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:51.360
miss not being able to do the things that I used to do.

00:36:51.680 --> 00:36:54.320
But the other two major things were practical things.

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:59.480
Like the main problem for me is leaking urine because yeah, I

